{
  "file_id": "3543",
  "text_count": 257,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������We've reached Server Continent!\nYaaaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 3685,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "It's so nice to be on solid\nground!",
      "_offset": 3736,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 75,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I didn't think it'd *actually*\ntake five days.",
      "_offset": 3772,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "It wouldn't have been unusual for\nit to have taken longer.",
      "_offset": 3819,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Yep, yep, it's all thanks to\nWhamon!",
      "_offset": 3878,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "This is a really big island.",
      "_offset": 3915,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "It's not an island, it's a\ncontinent!",
      "_offset": 3944,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "First time bein' on so much land.",
      "_offset": 3982,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "So this is Server Continent...",
      "_offset": 4016,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "So, where do we go now?",
      "_offset": 4047,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Whamon said there's a Koromon\nvillage in the forest.",
      "_offset": 4071,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 151,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Koromon? By Koromon, you mean...",
      "_offset": 4124,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 86,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I used to be a Koromon.",
      "_offset": 4157,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 87,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Oh, right!",
      "_offset": 4181,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "The Koromon should be willing to\nhelp us.",
      "_offset": 4192,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 87,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "A Koromon village in the middle of\nthe forest? Lemme take a quick\nlook.",
      "_offset": 4234,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 86,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Anything you see?",
      "_offset": 4309,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "There's a huge gap in the middle\nof the forest. I bet that's the\nvillage.",
      "_offset": 4327,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Well then, that seems to settle\nit.",
      "_offset": 4401,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Okay, let's head there!",
      "_offset": 4437,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 151,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Wow! It's the Koromon village!",
      "_offset": 4461,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "I wanna take a bath!",
      "_offset": 4492,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 151,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Wait a minute, Mimi!",
      "_offset": 4513,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 86,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "A bath, a bath, a bath!",
      "_offset": 4534,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Seriously?",
      "_offset": 4558,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "She's always off in her own\nworld...",
      "_offset": 4569,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 4606,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 87,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "What's wrong, Agumon?",
      "_offset": 4611,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "There aren't any Koromon here,\njust a bunch of Pagumon...",
      "_offset": 4633,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "They definitely don't look like\nKoromon.",
      "_offset": 4691,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 86,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "So Whamon was wrong...",
      "_offset": 4732,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 87,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Well, we'll just have to talk to\nthem for now!",
      "_offset": 4755,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Hey, I heard there's a Koromon\nvillage around here, but...",
      "_offset": 4802,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 151,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "This is the Pagumon village ♪",
      "_offset": 4861,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "So it really is a Pagumon village.",
      "_offset": 4892,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Umm...",
      "_offset": 4927,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Heehee! Hi, insects!",
      "_offset": 4934,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Hey, is he calling me an insect?",
      "_offset": 4955,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Pagumon are said to be nasty\nDigimon.",
      "_offset": 4988,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 64,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "It's a joke! We're giving you a\nwarm welcome here!",
      "_offset": 5026,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "They're good Digimon...right?",
      "_offset": 5077,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 65,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Are there only Pagumon in this\nvillage? Like, say, are there any\nKoromon...?",
      "_offset": 5107,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Koromon? I've never seen any\nDigimon called Koromon!",
      "_offset": 5184,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 64,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "You've never seen a Koromon, not\neven once?",
      "_offset": 5237,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 37,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Nope, nope! Never!",
      "_offset": 5281,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Well, then...",
      "_offset": 5300,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "We came here from File Island...",
      "_offset": 5314,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "File Island? More importantly,\nlook how cute we are!",
      "_offset": 5347,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "They're cute, but...",
      "_offset": 5400,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "They're pretty suspicious.",
      "_offset": 5421,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 42,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Waaaaaaaah! Waaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 5448,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Sorry! I didn't mean it like that.",
      "_offset": 5474,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Heh heh heh! I'm kidding, I'm\nkidding!",
      "_offset": 5509,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Haha, you scared me.",
      "_offset": 5548,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "We're searching for the Koromon\nvillage, but...",
      "_offset": 5569,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 64,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Wah! I've never seen this Digimon\nbefore!",
      "_offset": 5617,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Oh, no. I'm not a Digimon, I'm a\nhuman.",
      "_offset": 5659,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 205,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "A hu-man? I've never heard of that\nkind of Digimon!",
      "_offset": 5699,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I *said*, I'm not a Digimon...",
      "_offset": 5751,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 205,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Hey, do you know of any Koromon?",
      "_offset": 5782,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Koromon? There's only Pagumon\nhere!",
      "_offset": 5815,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "This is weird...",
      "_offset": 5851,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Mimi! So you were here!",
      "_offset": 5868,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Ah! Tai! It doesn't look like\nthere are any Koromon here.",
      "_offset": 5892,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Yeah, no matter where you go,\nthere's just Pagumon.",
      "_offset": 5953,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "It's weird! I could have sworn I\nsmelled Koromon...",
      "_offset": 6005,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 205,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Maybe it used to be a Koromon\nvillage, and the Koromon moved\naway.",
      "_offset": 6057,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 173,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "But it smells like they were here\nrecently.",
      "_offset": 6124,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Thank you for coming, everyone!\nWe've prepared a feast for you!",
      "_offset": 6168,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Yaaaaay! I'm starving!",
      "_offset": 6232,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 117,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Me, too!",
      "_offset": 6255,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 64,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Well, let's stay here for the day.",
      "_offset": 6264,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 205,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "The food was great!",
      "_offset": 6299,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "I felt like Otohime when she\narrived at the Dragon Palace!",
      "_offset": 6319,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 117,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "You mean Urashima Taro.",
      "_offset": 6378,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Ah! Poyomon!",
      "_offset": 6402,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "He's glowing...",
      "_offset": 6415,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 64,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Fwaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 6431,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 37,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Aaaaaah! It's Tokomon!",
      "_offset": 6441,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 65,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Congrats on evolving!",
      "_offset": 6464,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 6486,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "T.K, let's do what we can!",
      "_offset": 6492,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 117,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "It's gonna be night soon.",
      "_offset": 6522,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 64,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Okay, we'll save all the\ninvestigation for tomorrow.",
      "_offset": 6548,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Let's sleep together, Tokomon!",
      "_offset": 6601,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 6632,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "*rustle, rustle*",
      "_offset": 6638,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 41,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "T.K? Are you going to the\nbathroom?",
      "_offset": 6655,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "*snicker*",
      "_offset": 6694,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Ah! Mffmffmfmf...",
      "_offset": 6704,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Come with us, quietly!",
      "_offset": 6722,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Yeah, yeah!",
      "_offset": 6745,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "(T.K...help me!)",
      "_offset": 6757,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 253,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "W-why are you doing this to me?",
      "_offset": 6777,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "It's 'cause you evolved!",
      "_offset": 6809,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Yeah! Yeah!",
      "_offset": 6834,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 41,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "How rude, how rude!",
      "_offset": 6846,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "So you're not good Digimon?",
      "_offset": 6866,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 64,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "It was all an act!",
      "_offset": 6894,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 17,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Were you fooled? Then you're\nstupid!",
      "_offset": 6913,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 27,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Stupid! Stupid!",
      "_offset": 6950,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 37,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "So, what's with that Tokomon?",
      "_offset": 6966,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Gazimon!",
      "_offset": 6996,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 75,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "He came with a bunch of humans!",
      "_offset": 7005,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Humans?",
      "_offset": 7037,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 73,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "They couldn't possibly be the\nChosen Children, can they?",
      "_offset": 7045,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 75,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "I'm gonna report this to Lord\nEtemon. I'll leave the rest to\nyou!",
      "_offset": 7102,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Got it! All you Pagumon have to\nkeep an eye on the humans. Don't\nlet them escape!",
      "_offset": 7168,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 7250,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "You, come with me!",
      "_offset": 7256,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 47,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "I'm scared. T.K...",
      "_offset": 7275,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "*yawn* Tokomon?",
      "_offset": 7297,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 75,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "What's wrong, T.K?",
      "_offset": 7313,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 243,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Tokomon's gone. We were sleeping\ntogether, but...",
      "_offset": 7335,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 75,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Agumon! Do you know anything about\nthis?",
      "_offset": 7385,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 87,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "I was sleeping so soundly, I\ndidn't even notice.",
      "_offset": 7426,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 89,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "I wonder where Tokomon went...",
      "_offset": 7475,
      "_length": 30,
